@startuml

title PWM + Limit Switch Homing Firmware

start

:Initialize GPIO;
:Configure PWM output;
:Configure limit switch input;
:Configure Serial UART;

:Start PWM;
:Print "HOMING_STARTED" over serial;

while (Limit switch triggered?) is (No)
    :Continue PWM signal;
    :Motor/Actuator moves toward home;
endwhile (Yes)

:Limit-switch interrupt occurs;

:Execute homing callback;

:Stop PWM;

:Print "HOMING_COMPLETE" over serial;

:Wait for next command;

stop

@enduml


